# A runtime registration is written under the bare name as well as the
# effective tree it authorized.
MODULE: ActsOnAuthorizedTreeRegistersUnderBothIds
TARGET: ActsOnAuthorizedTree
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a registration also lands under the unresolved name
PERTURBS: Act

--- FIND
                 /\ catalog' = [catalog EXCEPT ![t] = @ \cup {c}]
--- REPLACE
                 /\ catalog' = [catalog EXCEPT ![t] = @ \cup {c}, ![req.n] = @ \cup {c}]
--- END
